128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Agriculture is the primary livelihood in Sokoto State, with millet, sorghum, maize, cowpea, and groundnut as staple crops. Livestock rearing \(goats, sheep, poultry\) complements crop production. Despite strong community reliance on agriculture, productivity is low due to traditional practices, poor infrastructure, and limited access to modern inputs. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Kware and Wamakko LGAs were selected for this assessment due to their high dependence on agriculture and vulnerability to climate shocks.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 58 0 R
/Pg 12 0 R
/A [488 0 R 0]
/K [5]
>>
endobj
131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (This report presents findings from a comprehensive needs assessment conducted in Kware and Wamakko LGAs, Sokoto State. Agriculture remains the backbone of household livelihoods, yet productivity is constrained by limited access to inputs, irrigation, markets, and financial services. Women and youth face systemic barriers, while climate variability exacerbates risks.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (The report recommends interventions in climate-smart agriculture, cooperative development, financial inclusion, and infrastructure improvement to strengthen resilience, food security, and income generation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
